&lt;p&gt;You’re a developer who values user-centric design, precision, and seamless collaboration. You bring structure to communication and thrive in a cross-functional environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is on-site in Berlin, where face-to-face interactions spark innovation and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
