&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Airbnb Hotels team is a fun, fast-growing group leading Airbnb’s expansion into the hotel sector. Operating with an entrepreneurial spirit, this team combines the simplicity, product excellence and guest-centred ethos that define Airbnb. Our mission is to deliver the smoothest, most intuitive hotel booking experience for guests, while helping hotel partners easily drive incremental bookings so they can focus on delivering the best hospitality. The ultimate aim is to help more people discover high-quality hotels, creating value for guests and our hotel partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global team. Open doors no one at Airbnb has opened yet.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb Hotels is one of the most exciting growth stories in travel, and we’re only getting started. As Manager, Key Accounts, you will build and lead a brand new, globally distributed team of Enterprise Account Managers. Together you will win and onboard high-value, above-property hotel groups with hundreds of hotels across multiple continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for someone who brings:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven leadership of a key, strategic or enterprise accounts team&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally globally distributed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A network and reputation in travel and hospitality&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally hotels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real negotiation experience &lt;/strong&gt;with high-value partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder’s mindset,&lt;/strong&gt; with a track record of creating teams, playbooks and processes where none existed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional influence&lt;/strong&gt; across a matrix organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end partner management at hotel headquarter and regional office level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mutual account plans that drive supply and strategic relationship value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The global Key Accounts strategy, in line with the Enterprise Team playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear mandate to consistently exceed quarterly business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;World-class account management practices, operational excellence and partner satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The voice of Key Accounts within Hotels leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, growth-oriented team that you mentor and motivate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position reports to the Global Head, Hotel Enterprise and Connectivity Partnerships, and offers a unique opportunity to shape Airbnb’s growth in the hotel market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead a brand new team&lt;/strong&gt; in a business that only launched this year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Key Accounts playbook&lt;/strong&gt; from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the relationships,&lt;/strong&gt; the targets and the strategy for a global segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with a leadership team that is moving fast &lt;/strong&gt;and backing this business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a distributed team of Enterprise Account Managers, supporting them on partner management and new business development for supply acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team’s quarterly revenue, supply acquisition and OKR targets, and ensure they are met and exceeded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take partners from first conversation through negotiation, signed deal and onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the Key Accounts playbook in line with global strategy, working closely with Hotel functional teams across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow relationships with multi-national hotel groups, acting as an escalation option for your team where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the operational rhythm for the team: establish and track KPIs, analyse growth and key metrics to identify trends, surface new business opportunities, and resolve business challenges with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Hotels field team in achieving their goals through well-designed field-level action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Technical Support, Connectivity, RevOps and Hotels Cross-Functional Leadership to drive feature adoption and business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Airbnb at industry and partner events, and organise internal partner events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold regular team meetings, 1:1s, and performance and development reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise team business gatherings, quarterly kick-offs and team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must-haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of professional experience and at least 8+ years in sales or account management roles in travel, hospitality or e-commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience managing and leading high-performing teams, with a proven track record of meeting and exceeding goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a globally distributed team and driving solutions to improve supply acquisition and revenue goals, ideally across international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with, or deep knowledge of, major hotel groups across the global hospitality landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset developed from experience having launched companies, teams or significant initiatives where resources, processes and capabilities had to be created, not handed to you or followed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of preparing and executing complex negotiations with high-value partner organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated team builder with the ability to coach and mentor account managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop a strategy, communicate it clearly, and secure buy-in and support to execute against quarterly goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills to identify opportunities, operationalise execution with regional teams, and drive business results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence senior executives, both within regional Airbnb leadership and within partner leadership teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work within a matrix, solve problems, and influence cross-functional and cross-regional teams, with strong stakeholder management across Marketing, Legal, FP&amp;amp;A, Payments, Product, regional field teams, and Enterprise and Connectivity teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel globally up to 60% of the time as needed to meet team members and engage with partners and customers at industry events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the hospitality technology space, including familiarity with OTAs and hotel distribution (strongly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and driving channel sales and marketing initiatives with global partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with tools such as CRM tools (Salesforce), project management tools (Asana, Airtable), and business intelligence tools (Tableau, Looker, Claude)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French or another major European language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€96.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€120.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted Go grows by signing new pick-up/drop-off locations, and a large share of that growth is delivered by external sales agencies. You will own that network: the agencies running our field sales, virtual calling and digital outreach across Europe and the US.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today these relationships are managed in a fragmented way. Your job is to turn them into one well-governed, high-performing extension of the acquisition team, with clear targets, a consistent operating rhythm and a single point of accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership role. You will act as an agency manager, performance analyst and budget owner, and above all as the guardian of the Vinted Go sales approach in every conversation an agency has on our behalf. You will build on the structure that already exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency &amp;amp; Channel Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full relationship with every outsourced sales partner across countries: onboarding, day-to-day management, escalations and offboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the single point of accountability for agency sales results, replacing today&#39;s fragmented oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and manage contracts, SLAs and commercial terms, including pay-for-performance structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, select and onboard new sales agencies as we enter new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build one operating framework (reporting cadence, WBRs, MBRs, escalation paths) that works the same way across agencies, channels and countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track sales KPIs and SLAs per agency, channel and market: conversion, signed locations per rep, productivity, lead quality and adherence to the Vinted Go pitch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that give real-time visibility into performance across the whole network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot underperforming agencies or markets early and drive corrective action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate acquisition targets set by leadership into agency-level performance expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run calibration and quality assurance (call reviews, field ride-alongs) so every agency sells consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the outsourced sales budget across all agencies and countries: forecasting, spend tracking and variance reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze cost per outcome (CAC, cost per signed location, cost per hour) across agencies, channels and markets to drive efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and execute cost optimizations without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on budget and performance regularly to finance and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the processes and governance needed to run a multi-agency, multi-country, multi-language sales network sustainably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain playbooks for opening new markets and onboarding new agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the acquisition team to align on targets, budgets and reporting standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior experience managing external sales agencies or outsourced sales teams (field sales, telesales, digital lead generation), ideally across several countries and vendors at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in sales, acquisition or growth in a high-velocity environment, so you know what good looks like on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong record of agency performance management: setting KPIs and SLAs, running WBRs and MBRs, and driving accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget ownership: forecasting, tracking and optimizing spend across multiple vendors or cost centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort building structure and process from a relatively unstructured starting point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, working easily in dashboards, reporting tools and a CRM to track performance and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills: you hold agencies accountable while keeping the partnership productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across time zones and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; French and/or Spanish is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outsourced sales is one of the main ways Vinted Go signs new locations at scale, and it is growing in every market we enter. This role brings order, accountability and cost discipline to that network, and lays the foundation for further international and product growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-contribution meal vouchers for each workday through a convenient meal card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Medical Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Role-Summary&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ad213d8fe4e2&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1929&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4daa64b4c380&quot;&gt;Nebius Token Factory is building production-grade inference for open-source, customer, and internally optimized models. This role owns the path from model artifact to fast, reliable, cost-efficient endpoint. The work sits at the intersection of model internals, inference engines, serving architecture, benchmarking, and production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;6b105a288faf&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-You-Will-Do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6b105a288faf&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebbff5d80805&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2528&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5115fb223c0&quot;&gt;Own a platform-level optimization pillar such as quantization, speculative decoding, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache optimization, engine selection, or long-context serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ffc3414d75f&quot;&gt;Create reusable evaluation, benchmarking, and rollout frameworks across multiple model families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2782&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b1093d4c9089&quot;&gt;Provide technical direction to MLEs, Applied Scientists, GPU kernel engineers, and infrastructure engineers on shared performance goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2922&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba8442a0b3db&quot;&gt;Optimize LLM and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; endpoints for latency, throughput, memory efficiency, GPU utilization, quality, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3046&quot; data-local-id=&quot;295f060f2f89&quot;&gt;Deploy, configure, benchmark, and extend inference engines such as vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, Triton Inference Server, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&lt;/span&gt; Dynamo, or similar systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3204&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a92060bc9227&quot;&gt;Build and productionize model-compression workflows, including quantization, quantization-aware training, distillation, low-bit serving, and accuracy recovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3367&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fc94ad87ea7d&quot;&gt;Implement or integrate speculative decoding, draft-model approaches, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache optimization, prefix caching, chunked prefill, continuous batching, and disaggregated prefill/decode serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3558&quot; data-local-id=&quot;767163fd69ef&quot;&gt;Build reproducible benchmark harnesses for &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TTFT&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TPOT&lt;/span&gt;, tokens per second per GPU, p95/p99 latency, GPU memory, reliability, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3705&quot; data-local-id=&quot;08931f048a7e&quot;&gt;Partner with GPU kernel engineers and platform engineers to diagnose bottlenecks across model code, kernels, runtime, scheduler, gateway, and cluster layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3866&quot; data-local-id=&quot;40fc2b50527b&quot;&gt;Write clear design docs, performance reports, rollout plans, and customer-facing technical explanations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Required-Qualifications&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d808b8c02bc9&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3974&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;000c2bf27478&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4001&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8bcf8dd9c7f9&quot;&gt;Strong Python and PyTorch engineering skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4050&quot; data-local-id=&quot;781d2e3f4c3f&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience deploying or optimizing LLM, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt;, or high-throughput transformer inference systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4157&quot; data-local-id=&quot;604abc69fbd4&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of at least one modern inference stack such as vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, Triton Inference Server, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&lt;/span&gt; Dynamo, Ray Serve, KServe, or equivalent internal systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4346&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3815fcf1bdd9&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of transformer inference bottlenecks, including &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt; cache, attention, memory bandwidth, batching, parallelism, and long-context serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4506&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7ade27b40b8&quot;&gt;Ability to reason quantitatively about latency, throughput, quality, utilization, and cost tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4611&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba5ac6530c91&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate with research, kernel, infrastructure, product, and customer teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Preferred-Qualifications&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8d0c1267a411&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4737&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;60367df2c185&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
