&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ffc3414d75f&quot;&gt;Create reusable evaluation, benchmarking, and rollout frameworks across multiple model families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2782&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b1093d4c9089&quot;&gt;Provide technical direction to MLEs, Applied Scientists, GPU kernel engineers, and infrastructure engineers on shared performance goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2922&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba8442a0b3db&quot;&gt;Optimize LLM and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; endpoints for latency, throughput, memory efficiency, GPU utilization, quality, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
